      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Move the on-screen joystick in the direction you want the car to go. The
    joystick''s movement directly controls the vehicle, making precision steering
    essential for tight corners.


    By pressing the gear shifter on the right
    side of the screen, you can switch between forward and reverse. Reverse can be
    used to recover from tricky spots or reposition yourself for smoother turns.


    You
    have only three laps to prove yourself. Get the fastest lap time by controlling
    the car with precision, navigating the track efficiently, and chasing it.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 46adeb7fee6d7f54caf73f85f537f117, type: 2}
